    section+='<p><strong>General rubric clarification:</strong> overcharges, duplicate charges, incorrect charged amounts and price-difference refund requests belong to refund_request. Account_help requires an actual technical account/checkout failure, such as inability to submit payment or complete checkout. A completed charge with a disputed amount is not by itself a technical checkout failure. No ticket ID, quoted example, human score or reference label was placed in judge requests.</p>'
