    section+='<p>This is calibration on a known disagreement, measured on the same known synthetic dataset. It is not independent held-out validation, and one rerun does not establish general judge reliability.</p>'
    section+='<p>LangSmith stores the original rubric-v1 metric separately from <code>week4_p4_v3_llm_judge_v2</code>. The user’s t033 review is stored separately as <code>week4_p4_v3_human_adjudicated_score</code>. New scores and the separate human review have been read back and verified; the old automated t033 score remains0.</p>'
    section+='<p><a href="llm_judge_v2/before_after.json">Before-and-after evidence</a> · <a href="llm_judge_v2/rubric.txt">Updated judge rubric</a> · <a href="llm_judge_v2/assessments.csv">All100 new judgments</a> · <a href="llm_judge_v2/review_needed.csv">Remaining ambiguity flags</a> · <a href="human_reviews/t033.json">Separate human review</a></p></section>'
    text=text.replace('<h2>Files</h2>',section+'<h2>Files</h2>')
